@startuml
title 09 - Cheque Service Blocks (Overview)
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "Gateway :8099" as GW
participant "Cheque Service :8093" as CHQ
database "Cheque DB" as CDB
participant "Auth Service :8091" as AUTH

group 1) Master Data (CHCM / CHCU / CHBM)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/cheque/companies/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/cheque/customers/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/cheque/banks/*
  GW -> CHQ: Forward
  CHQ -> CDB: CRUD + filter + status
  CHQ -> AUTH: /internal/role-page-tasks/{roleCode}/get\n(reference-data privileges)
  CHQ --> FE: response
end

group 2) Voucher Create + Approval (CHVC / CHVM / CHAM)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/cheque/voucher-create
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/cheque/vouchers/*
  GW -> CHQ: Forward
  CHQ -> CDB: Save voucher + invoice lines
  CHQ -> CDB: DRAFT -> PENDING_APPROVAL -> APPROVED/REJECTED
  CHQ --> FE: response + PDF export
end

group 3) Cheque Print + Reprint Request (CHCP)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/cheque/cheques/*
  GW -> CHQ: Forward
  CHQ -> CDB: Load APPROVED/CHEQUE_CREATED voucher
  CHQ -> CDB: Update printCount + printStatus
  CHQ -> CDB: Save reprint request when needed
  CHQ --> FE: cheque PDF / download
end

group 4) Reprint Approval (CHAP)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/cheque/cheque-approvals/*
  GW -> CHQ: Forward
  CHQ -> CDB: REPRINT_PENDING -> REPRINT_APPROVED/REPRINT_REJECTED
  CHQ --> FE: response
end

note over FE,CHQ
Detailed split diagrams:
- 09a-cheque-company-management.puml
- 09b-cheque-customer-management.puml
- 09c-cheque-bank-management.puml
- 09d-cheque-voucher-management.puml
- 09e-cheque-print-reprint.puml
- 09f-cheque-reprint-approval.puml
end note

@enduml
